転フラップ式案内表示機を使い、出発ボードが見えること\n・「Northampton」という標識が見えること（これは駅の名前であり、到着した乗客はこれを見て目的地に到着したことを確認できる）\n・不思議で魅力的なイメージであること\n\n出発ボードには以下の行と列がある：\nTime, No., Train, To, Status\n08:29, 7, WAVERIDER, OAK SHADE, BOARDING\n12:29, 9, WAVERIDER, OAK SHADE, ON TIME\n16:29, 11, WAVERIDER, OAK SHADE, ON TIME\n\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@2gi0gi_/works/53", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/04777562/uploads/origins/eb8eab5e-5e05-4d5c-8495-0b7a73f6bfea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e3918b54d51da4dcdb11c8965976bf6a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04777562/uploads/origins/eb8eab5e-5e05-4d5c-8495-0b7a73f6bfea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e3918b54d51da4dcdb11c8965976bf6a, https://si.imgix.net/04777562/uploads/origins/eb8eab5e-5e05-4d5c-8495-0b7a73f6bfea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c4385145ed22cae08aaef4294679fc82 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04777562/uploads/origins/eb8eab5e-5e05-4d5c-8495-0b7a73f6bfea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=22e7da6cedc88123cf33eb0d55015533 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@2gi0gi_/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/be6e9396/uploads/origins/2be543fc-4cbe-461d-83e6-b77f35f15cce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b26a906c4750752bd3bf260189ff6d9a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/be6e9396/uploads/origins/2be543fc-4cbe-461d-83e6-b77f35f15cce?bg=